{"id":"3453e924fc352c67","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-exact-pair.md","title":"度序列的精确对","display":"df-exact-pair — 度序列的精确对","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-exact-pair","aliases":["20-df-exact-pair"],"display":"df-exact-pair — 度序列的精确对","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 6.5.2","source_pdf_pages":[176],"source_printed_pages":[142],"depends_on":["[[20-df-degle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-exact-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-exact-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exact-pair — 度序列的精确对"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 6.5.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf b_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\((\\mathbf b_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 是递增度序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ExactPair}(\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1;(\\mathbf b_n))\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n[(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall i&lt;2\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf a_i)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf c\\ ((\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a_1)\n\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\ \\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf b_n)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ExactPair}(\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1;(\\mathbf b_n))\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n[(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall i&lt;2\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf a_i)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf c\\ ((\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a_1)\n\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\ \\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf b_n)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一量词表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega,i&lt;2\">\\(n\\in\\omega,i&lt;2\\)</span>。共同下锥恰是序列生成的理想；序列的所有成员是两边下度，故后向包含自动成立。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.5.2；印刷页 142；PDF 第 176 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-degle]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathbf b_n)_{n\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}exact\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ExactPair}(\\mathbf a_0,\\mathbf a_1;(\\mathbf b_n))\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n[(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall i<2\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf a_i)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf c\\ ((\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a_0\\land\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a_1)\n\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\ \\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf b_n)].","display":true},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega,i<2","display":false}],"bytes":1198,"backlinks":[{"id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-exact-pair]]；see [[20-df-column-thickness]]；see [[20-df-partial-compatibility]]；see [[20-lem-compatible-cross-search]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-exact-pair]] — 章 6；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-exact-pair]]"}],"outgoing":["e888141c21b61ce5"]}